OL,3,GNEWSAEvent aims to revive 'glory days' 
OL,4,Aof city nightlife                      
OL,6,FA Wolverhampton events promoter is     
OL,7,Fhoping to turn back the clock and      
OL,8,Fremind people of the city's nightclub  
OL,9,Fheyday with a nostalgia-fuelled event. 
OL,11,FLiam Pace, who has worked in the city's
OL,12,Fhospitality industry for about 15      
OL,13,Fyears, said he wanted to recreate the  
OL,14,Fatmosphere of Wolverhampton's "glory   
OL,15,Fdays" after watching its nightlife     
OL,16,Fdecline over the past two decades.     
OL,18,FThe event, called Reunion, will take   
OL,19,Fplace at the Apollo on Saturday and    
OL,20,Ffeatures music from the early 2000s to 
OL,21,F2015.                                  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
