OL,3,GNEWSAEvent aims to revive 'glory days' 
OL,4,Aof city nightlife                      
OL,6,F"Wolverhampton was quite prominent with
OL,7,Fits nightlife but over time, through   
OL,8,Fone reason or another, venues have     
OL,9,Fclosed. It's just not the same as what 
OL,10,Fit used to be and doesn't have the pull
OL,11,Fit once had," he said.                 
